flowchart TD
  All([All tasks]) --> F1[Filter 1: archived?<br/>drop if archived_at set]
  F1 --> F2[Filter 2: priority<br/>drop if priority not in filter<br/>empty filter = no constraint<br/>UNIVERSAL — no bypass]
  F2 --> F3[Filter 3: status<br/>drop if status not in filter<br/>BYPASS: pinned, active session,<br/>or open-tab + showAllOpen]
  F3 --> F4[Filter 4: temporary<br/>drop if temp && !showTemporary<br/>BYPASS: open-tab + showAllOpen]
  F4 --> F5[Filter 5: only-active<br/>drop if showOnlyActive<br/>&& !pinned && !session<br/>BYPASS: open-tab + showAllOpen]
  F5 --> Survivors([Survivors])
  Survivors --> Post[Post-process:<br/>add parent chain<br/>so hierarchy stays connected]
  Post --> Visible([visibleTaskIds])

  classDef filter fill:#1e3a8a,color:#fff
  classDef bypass fill:#92400e,color:#fff
  class F1,F2 filter
  class F3,F4,F5 bypass
